. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a6-fnhTrGuIQ7kNvwE1TmBK&_nc_oc=AdoyjaAibuN1UTlT-mekRS7qFNYhhdQGUG7NsgXp6LT0CRgMh6yvOcxtX47V2TXvTXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7QHYYRlXxm5f4ugrSCx3fhE16IglOywWF8TupYAt_sqw&oe=6A0324BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ggZKCZCvGmEQ7kNvwGphV7-&_nc_oc=Ado3nNSY5m1vcTw486AOasOrkLhDkVJ1GnGDXhvuchPRNRAM7dlfZHXqJ-zCOcknjBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4K1PwkJ99UngMF0lxOud5C8QNvW8tuMTGmlHhJ83ybpw&oe=6A033B5E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eDaYC0pajXYQ7kNvwFzM1Cb&_nc_oc=AdpYQUcisMGtJ4dMrWfFAib0M5U9yjZPAP25dorQyy2qNRNbXRP-iZ1MZlFwYWsysSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4I8lUkpSY5JBzd74fF2BynwOfNk6BGKs3Cpu-F8uu_tQ&oe=6A0330DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco